      "Language": "rus",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "A study of the cardiac ejection, peripheral tissue oxygen utilization, changes of lipoprotein cholesterol concentration, radical and antioxidant activity of blood plasma under the effect of hyperbaric oxygenation revealed that hyperbaric oxygenation stabilizes the cell membranes increasing the functional capacities of cells and organs manifested in an enhancement of the oxidation-reduction processes in the tissues, increase of the cardiac ejection and initially reduced concentrations of high-density lipoprotein cholesterol."},
